{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42164","headline":"寄歙州吕判官 · 徐铉","name":"寄歙州吕判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"任公郡占好山川，谿水萦回路屈盘。\n南国自来推胜境，故人此地作郎官。\n风光适意须留恋，禄秩资贫且喜欢。\n莫忆班行重回首，是非多处是长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}